      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2902155943,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Thank you for your comments.\n\nWhen the OPEN Message is not included in a pcap, we can't know whether the peer should allow an extended message or not.\n\nI added this preference for those who want that message to be treated as an error as before. I think it is also another simple option to disable the maximum length check.",
